  "prefLabel": "Fis 403.10 Smelt (Osmerus mordax)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 403.10 Smelt (Osmerus mordax). The daily bag limit for smelt shall be 2 quarts liquid measure of whole, with head and tail intact, freshwater smelt in the 24 hours between 12 o'clock noon one day and 12 o'clock noon the following day except as otherwise provided in Fis 502.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Fis 400 and Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 500) #5016, eff 1-1-91; ss by #5292, eff 12-20-91; ss by #6432, eff 1-21-97; ss by #6629, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8442, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13698, eff 7-26-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 400)",
